**TRACK: No Woman No Cry**
key: C | tempo: 76 | swing: 0% | subdivision: 8th

[intro]
Chords: C | G | Am | F (x2)
Melody: (hold C root, gentle stabs on 2 & 4)
@drums: reggae skank, rimshot on 2 & 4, hi-hat 8ths, kick on 1 & 3
@bass: root on 1, octave skip up on 3, light syncopation
@guitar: upstroke skank on 2 & 4, muted chords
@keys: organ pad, sustained C triad, add G triad on 4

[verse]
Chords: C | G | Am | F (each 1 bar, repeat)
Lyrics:
No woman, no cry
No woman, no cry
Here, little darling, don't shed no tears
No woman, no cry

Melody: (vocal line, syncopated, starts on beat 2)
C: “No wo-” (G3, pick-up 8th) “-man” (A3, on 2) “no” (G3, on 3&) “cry” (E3, on 4)
G: “No wo-” (B3, pick-up) “-man” (C4, on 2) “no” (B3, on 3&) “cry” (G3, on 4)
Am: “Here, little dar-” (A3, C4, B3, A3) “-ling” (G3, on 4)
F: “don't shed no tears” (F3, E3, D3, C3, on 2-4)
@drums: skank on 2 & 4, rimshot, kick on 1, snare ghost on 3&
@bass: C1 on 1, G1 on 3, then A1, F1 pattern, walking feel
@guitar: skank chords, slight palm mute, upstroke only
@keys: organ comping, stabs on 2 & 4, add F chord on last beat of each bar

[chorus]
Chords: Am | F | C | G (each 1 bar, repeat)
Lyrics:
No woman, no cry (say)
No woman, no cry (hey)
Little darling, don't shed no tears
No woman, no cry

Melody: (higher register, call-and-response feel)
Am: “No woman” (A3, C4 on 2, 3&) “no cry” (B3, A3 on 4)
F: “No woman” (F3, A3 on 2, 3&) “no cry” (G3, F3 on 4)
C: “Little darling” (E4, D4, C4 on 2-3) “don't shed” (G3, A3 on 4&)
G: “no tears” (B3, G3 on 2, 3) “no woman, no cry” (D4, C4, B3, G3 on 4)
@drums: fuller groove, add open hi-hat on 8ths, rimshot on 2 & 4, kick on 1 & 3
@bass: walking pattern, A2-F2-C3-G2, with octave fills
@guitar: skank with slight wah, add double upstroke on 4&
@keys: organ, add horn stab on 4 of each bar, pad on whole chords

[outro]
Chords: C | G | Am | F (repeat, fade)
Melody: (vocal ad-lib, “No woman, no cry” repeats, descending)
@drums: keep groove, brush on snare, hi-hat soft, rimshot on 2 & 4
@bass: long roots, hold C, G, A, F each 2 bars
@guitar: skank, let chords ring on 4, fade out
@keys: organ pad, sustain C, add G, A, F with slow release
@vocal: ad-lib “no cry” echoes, “everything's gonna be alright” (on C chord)
